    "characteristic_uuid": "00010203-0405-0607-0809-0a0b0c0d2b11",
    "frame": "20 bytes: [0]=proType 0x33 write / 0xAA read / 0xA3-0xA5 multi; [1]=cmdType; [2..18]=payload; [19]=XOR BCC. H70B3+ uses com.govee.matter.pact.BleComm, matter frames use proType 0xAB.",
